 "description": "Use this when the user asks whether a brand is reputable or what kind of brand it is (an established name, a store's own label, an independent maker, or a generic white-label name), or wants brands compared while shopping. Returns findings on each brand: what kind of brand it is, its reputation for quality and its usual price tier, each with a confidence. Signals only, never a buy or avoid verdict. Does not browse the web and is not for banking, health or email pages. Pass brand names as the user or the listing gave them, up to 50 per call.",
